## Modules: timeDay.sys
## Date and Time

## Time/Day panel color
*FvwmScript: DefaultColorset 50

Module FvwmButtons TimeDayButton

DestroyModuleConfig TimeDayButton:*
*TimeDayButton: Geometry 120x60-0-50
*TimeDayButton: Columns 120
*TimeDayButton: Colorset 50
*TimeDayButton: Font "xft:Sans:Bold:size=14:antialias=True"
*TimeDayButton: (120x50, Swallow DateTime 'Module FvwmScript FvwmScript-DateTime', Frame 0)

Style TimeDayButton NoTitle, !Handles, BorderWidth 0, BorderColorset 13, Sticky, WindowListSkip, FixedSize, !Iconifiable, NeverFocus, StaysOnBottom
